{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1510160-spear-of-bathel","id":1510160,"title":"Spear of Bathel","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-04-29T22:03:57-07:00","id":1510160,"title":"Spear of Bathel","content":"So, I was reading Becket's Diary and came upon something I haven't paid attention before (I really love when this happens), this artifact called &quot;Spear of Bathel&quot; that according to BJD is in possession of Siegfried. The text for one of the ideas for stories states that the spear shields the wielder from damage and is able to slay any foe it even scratches, yet for some reason, Siegfried wants to sell it. It's the first time I hear from this artifact and according to the text it's very powerful. Am I the only one who haven't heard of it before!? This could make some interesting stories.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12348-herr-meister","name":"Herr Meister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-30T00:05:14-07:00","id":1510166,"title":"","content":"Not ring the bell, but I guess it is some old relic from the game line's early supplements like the Gian's Blood, Sword of Troile, Blade of Enoch, Tablet of Destiny or Tapestry of Blood...<br /> I'm not home so can't chek, but if anything, it could be in the Dark Alliance: Vancouver or Prince's Primer (Mind's Eye Theatre supplement)<br /> But it is totally possible, BJD just &quot;invented&quot; it \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"att